<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment sent · {{appName}}</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  {{!-- Opened on the guest's phone after GCash / Maya; kept self-contained (no app CSS). --}}
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #FAF9F6; color: #1f2a24; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
    main { max-width: 22rem; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    .mark { width: 3.5rem; height: 3.5rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem; border-radius: 9999px; background: #2E5F45; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.75rem; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
    p { margin: 0; color: #637369; line-height: 1.5; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
    <h1>Thank you</h1>
    <p>Your e-wallet has sent the payment. The cashier's screen will confirm it in a few seconds. You can close this page.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
